{"id":"ics-036","stemHtml":"<p>函数 <code>sum</code> 的汇编实现如下（参数 <code>a</code> 在 <code>%rdi</code>，<code>n</code> 在 <code>%rsi</code>，返回值在 <code>%rax</code>）：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-text\">sum:\n    movl  $0, %eax\n    movl  $0, %ecx\n    jmp   .L2\n.L3:\n    movq  (%rdi,%rax,8), %rdx\n    addq  %rdx, %rcx\n    addq  $1, %rax\n.L2:\n    cmpq  %rsi, %rax\n    jl    .L3\n    movq  %rcx, %rax\n    ret</code></pre></p>\n<p>（1）写出与之等价的 C 代码（用 <code>while</code> 或 <code>for</code>）。</p>\n<p>（2）若 <code>a = {1, -2, 3, -4}</code>、<code>n = 4</code>，函数返回多少？</p>\n<p>（3）如果把 <code>jl</code> 改成 <code>jle</code>，循环会怎样变化？会带来什么问题？</p>\n<p>（4）如果数组元素类型从 <code>long</code> 改成 <code>int</code>，需要修改哪些指令？如果改成 <code>unsigned int</code> 呢？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p>先找循环的三要素：循环变量、循环条件、循环体。<code>%rax</code> 从 0 开始每轮加 1，<code>%rcx</code> 累加 <code>a[i]</code>，<code>jl</code> 是「有符号小于」。注意 AT&amp;T 的 <code>cmpq %rsi, %rax</code> 计算的是 <code>%rax - %rsi</code>。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>关键的那一步为什么能想到。</strong> 汇编里的循环通常由「初始化 → 跳到条件判断 → 循环体 → 条件判断」四块组成。先找出哪个寄存器在递增（<code>%rax</code>，即 <code>i</code>）、哪个在累加（<code>%rcx</code>，即 <code>s</code>）、哪个数在控制终止（<code>%rsi</code>，即 <code>n</code>），再按 <code>cmp</code> 的操作数方向读出条件是 <code>i &lt; n</code>。把这三件事对上，C 代码就出来了。</p>\n<p>（1）等价 C 代码：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">long sum(long *a, long n) {\n    long i = 0;\n    long s = 0;\n    while (i &lt; n) {\n        s += a[i];\n        i++;\n    }\n    return s;\n}</code></pre></p>\n<p>（2）逐项累加：\n<span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+(-2)+3+(-4)=-2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2.</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n所以返回 <code>-2</code>。</p>\n<p>（3）<code>jl</code> 是有符号「小于」，改成 <code>jle</code> 后条件变成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i\\le n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7955em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>，循环体会执行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 次，最后一次用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i=n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 访问 <code>a[n]</code>。<code>a</code> 的有效下标是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，<code>a[n]</code> 已经越界，属于未定义行为：可能读到相邻变量、触发放错误的内存保护，也可能只是悄悄返回一个错值。</p>\n<p>（4）<code>long</code> 元素占 8 字节，所以用 <code>movq</code> 和比例因子 8。改成 <code>int</code>（4 字节）后：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>取数指令要变成 <code>movslq (%rdi,%rax,4), %rdx</code>——<code>movslq</code> 把 32 位有符号数符号扩展到 64 位，才能参与 <code>addq</code> 的 64 位加法；</li>\n<li>比例因子由 8 改成 4；</li>\n<li>其余（<code>addq</code>、<code>cmpq</code>、返回 <code>long</code>）不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果元素是 <code>unsigned int</code>，则用 <code>movl (%rdi,%rax,4), %edx</code> 即可：32 位写 <code>%edx</code> 时高 32 位自动清零，等价于零扩展，不需要 <code>movslq</code>。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把 <code>cmpq %rsi, %rax</code> 的方向读反，写成条件 <code>n &lt; i</code>，导致判断循环一次都不执行。二是把 <code>%rcx</code> 当成循环变量、<code>%rax</code> 当成累加器，寄存器角色看错。三是没注意 <code>jl</code> 是有符号比较：如果 <code>n</code> 是负数，<code>i &lt; n</code> 一开始就不成立，循环不执行；若换成 <code>jb</code>（无符号），负数会被当成巨大的无符号数，循环会越界跑很久。四是改 <code>int</code> 数组时只改比例因子、忘了用 <code>movslq</code> 做符号扩展，或者对 <code>unsigned</code> 误用 <code>movslq</code>。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>（1）等价于 <code>long sum(long *a, long n)</code> 的 while 循环求和；（2）<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>；（3）循环执行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 次，会越界读 <code>a[n]</code>；（4）<code>int</code> 数组要把 <code>movq</code> 换成 <code>movslq (%rdi,%rax,4), %rdx</code>、比例因子 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span> 换成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></p>\n"}